  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIHR RIGHT 3: CONTROL (COgNitive Therapy for depRessiOn in tubercuLosis treatment)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIHR Research and Innovation for Global Health Transformation Call 3: CONTROL (COgNitive Therapy for depRessiOn in tubercuLosis treatment) programme of research to improve outcomes for depression and TB in Pakistan and Afghanistan refugees living in Pakistan. A UK and low- and middle-income country (LMIC) research partnership to develop and test a psychosocial intervention for treating depression in TB and improving adherence with antituberclosis treatment (ATT) in Pakistan and Afghanistan refugees living in Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
